==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|kol}}, from {{inh|de|goh|kol}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*kulą}}, from {{inh|de|ine-pro|*gʷol-}}, from {{m|ine-pro|*ǵwelH-||to burn, shine}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|kool}}, {{cog|da|kul}}, {{cog|en|coal}}.

